====== EnGenius ENS202EXT 1.0.0======

The EnGenius ENS202EXT is a high power (400mW) outdoor access point with 2 detachable RP-SMA antennas.

This page is for ENS202EXT v1 hardware (available 2013-2018, FCC ID: A8J-ENS202, factory software v1.x)

NOT the ENS202EXT v2 hardware (released 2018, FCC ID: A8J-ENS202EXTV2, factory software v3.x).

Please check the FCC ID on the label of your hardware to make sure your device is v1 and not v2.  Ignore the "HW v" on the label - it may not say 2.0.0 for v2 hardware.

